2 rows in set (0.00 sec)

### 4. What is your TiDB version? (Required)

Release Version: v5.2.0-alpha-529-g1a54708a7
Edition: Community
Git Commit Hash: 1a54708a7f8f86515236626c78e97a33d8adf583
Git Branch: HEAD
